<title>USA: GOLF-FIRST ROUND LEADERS AT PGA FREEPORT-MCDERMOTT CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FIRST ROUND LEADERS AT PGA FREEPORT-MCDERMOTT CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the first</p>
<p>round of the $1.5 million Freeport-McDermott Classic golf</p>
<p>tournament on Thursday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>65 Scott McCarron, Larry Rinker, David Toms</p>
<p>66 Hideki Kase (Japan)</p>
<p>67 Greg Norman (Australia), Larry Silveira</p>
<p>68 Bob Tway, Neal Lancaster, Scott Hoch, Bradley Hughes</p>
<p>(Australia), Billy Mayfair, Brad Faxon, Ted Tryba</p>
<p>69 Yoshinori Kaneko (Japan), Jerry Kelly, Brian Henninger,</p>
<p>Payne Stewart, Marco Dawson, Davis Love, Lanny Wadkins</p>
<p>Add non-U.S. scores</p>
<p>71 Steve Elkington (Australia), Costantino Rocca (Italy)</p>
<p>72 Jesper Parnevik (Sweden), Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand),</p>
<p>Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain)</p>
<p>73 Wayne Grady (Australia), Grant Waite (New Zealand)</p>
<p>75 Gabriel Hjerstedt (Sweden)</p>
<p>82 Per-Ulrik Johnasson (Sweden), Rafael Alarcon (Mexico)</p>
</text>
